          "id": "code-ml-16-2-ch16_2_scratch",
          "title": "First-Principles NumPy: Bukti Ketakbiasan Rescaling GOSS (1-a)/b & EFB Graph Coloring + Bin Offset",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "16_2_lightgbm_goss_efb_scratch.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\n\n\ndef exact_variance_gain(x: np.ndarray, g: np.ndarray, thr: float) -> float:\n    n = len(g)\n    left = x <= thr\n    n_l = int(np.sum(left))\n    n_r = n - n_l\n    if n_l == 0 or n_r == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    G_l = float(np.sum(g[left]))\n    G_r = float(np.sum(g[~left]))\n    return (G_l * G_l / n_l + G_r * G_r / n_r) / n\n\n\ndef goss_variance_gain(\n    x: np.ndarray,\n    g: np.ndarray,\n    thr: float,\n    a: float,\n    b: float,\n    rng: np.random.Generator,\n    apply_rescaling: bool = True,\n) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Persamaan (2) Ke et al. (2017): GOSS Variance Gain dengan rescaling (1-a)/b.\"\"\"\n    n = len(g)\n    top_n = max(1, int(round(a * n)))\n    rand_n = max(1, int(round(b * n)))\n    order = np.argsort(np.abs(g))[::-1]\n    top_idx = order[:top_n]\n    rest_idx = order[top_n:]\n    rand_idx = rng.choice(rest_idx, size=min(rand_n, len(rest_idx)), replace=False)\n\n    scale = (1.0 - a) / b if apply_rescaling else 1.0\n    left_top = x[top_idx] <= thr\n    left_rand = x[rand_idx] <= thr\n\n    n_l_exact = int(np.sum(x <= thr))\n    n_r_exact = n - n_l_exact\n    if n_l_exact == 0 or n_r_exact == 0:\n        return 0.0\n\n    G_l_hat = float(np.sum(g[top_idx[left_top]])) + scale * float(np.sum(g[rand_idx[left_rand]]))\n    G_r_hat = float(np.sum(g[top_idx[~left_top]])) + scale * float(np.sum(g[rand_idx[~left_rand]]))\n    return (G_l_hat * G_l_hat / n_l_exact + G_r_hat * G_r_hat / n_r_exact) / n\n\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(162)\nn = 1500\nx_col = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\n# Distribusi gradien berat-ekor (sebagian kecil sampel under-trained punya |g| besar)\ng_col = np.where(x_col > 0.25, 1.8, -1.4) + rng.normal(0.0, 0.7, size=n)\ng_col[rng.choice(n, size=120, replace=False)] *= 4.0\nthr_eval = 0.25\n\nexact_v = exact_variance_gain(x_col, g_col, thr_eval)\ngoss_scaled, goss_unscaled = [], []\nfor _ in range(60):\n    goss_scaled.append(goss_variance_gain(x_col, g_col, thr_eval, a=0.20, b=0.10, rng=rng, apply_rescaling=True))\n    goss_unscaled.append(goss_variance_gain(x_col, g_col, thr_eval, a=0.20, b=0.10, rng=rng, apply_rescaling=False))\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Bukti Ketakbiasan Rescaling GOSS (1-a)/b = 8.0 (60 Trial, 30% Data Dipakai) ===\")\nprint(f\"Exact Variance Gain (100% baris)      : {exact_v:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"GOSS dengan rescaling (1-a)/b = 8.0   : mean={np.mean(goss_scaled):.4f} | bias={np.mean(goss_scaled)-exact_v:+.4f} | std={np.std(goss_scaled):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"TANPA rescaling (bobot=1.0, BIAS!)    : mean={np.mean(goss_unscaled):.4f} | bias={np.mean(goss_unscaled)-exact_v:+.4f} | std={np.std(goss_unscaled):.4f}\")\n\n# 2. Exclusive Feature Bundling (EFB): Greedy Graph Coloring + Bin-Offset Merging\nn_rows, n_feats = 1000, 12\n# 3 grup fitur one-hot/eksklusif (masing-masing 4 fitur, hanya 1 aktif per baris -> konflik 0!)\nX_sparse = np.zeros((n_rows, n_feats), dtype=int)\nfor grp in range(3):\n    active_col = rng.integers(0, 4, size=n_rows)\n    vals = rng.integers(1, 5, size=n_rows)  # bin 1..4 per fitur\n    X_sparse[np.arange(n_rows), grp * 4 + active_col] = vals\n\n# Hitung matriks konflik antar-fitur & greedy bundling (Algoritma 3-4 Ke et al. 2017)\nnz = X_sparse > 0\nconflict = (nz.T.astype(int) @ nz.astype(int))\nnp.fill_diagonal(conflict, 0)\ndegrees = conflict.sum(axis=1)\norder_f = np.argsort(degrees)[::-1]\nmax_conflict = int(0.005 * n_rows)\n\nbundles: list[list[int]] = []\nfor f in order_f:\n    placed = False\n    for b_list in bundles:\n        c_sum = sum(int(conflict[f, existing]) for existing in b_list)\n        if c_sum <= max_conflict:\n            b_list.append(int(f))\n            placed = True\n            break\n    if not placed:\n        bundles.append([int(f)])\n\n# Gabungkan setiap bundel memakai bin-offset sehingga nilai tiap fitur tetap dapat dibedakan eksak!\nbundled_cols = []\nfor b_list in bundles:\n    offset = 0\n    merged = np.zeros(n_rows, dtype=int)\n    for f in b_list:\n        max_bin = int(X_sparse[:, f].max())\n        mask = X_sparse[:, f] > 0\n        merged[mask] = X_sparse[mask, f] + offset\n        offset += max_bin\n    bundled_cols.append(merged)\nX_efb = np.column_stack(bundled_cols)\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Exclusive Feature Bundling (EFB) Greedy Graph Coloring + Bin Offset ===\")\nprint(f\"Dimensi awal (sparse)    : {X_sparse.shape[1]} kolom | Kompresi -> {X_efb.shape[1]} bundel ({100*(1 - X_efb.shape[1]/X_sparse.shape[1]):.1f}% lebih ramping)\")\nfor idx_b, b_list in enumerate(bundles):\n    print(f\"  Bundel #{idx_b}: fitur {sorted(b_list)} | rentang bin gabungan = [0 .. {int(X_efb[:, idx_b].max())}]\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Bukti Ketakbiasan Rescaling GOSS (1-a)/b = 8.0 (60 Trial, 30% Data Dipakai) ===\nExact Variance Gain (100% baris)      : 3.6725\nGOSS dengan rescaling (1-a)/b = 8.0   : mean=3.6602 | bias=-0.0123 | std=0.1567\nTANPA rescaling (bobot=1.0, BIAS!)    : mean=0.9524 | bias=-2.7201 | std=0.0113\n\n=== 2. Exclusive Feature Bundling (EFB) Greedy Graph Coloring + Bin Offset ===\nDimensi awal (sparse)    : 12 kolom | Kompresi -> 3 bundel (75.0% lebih ramping)\n  Bundel #0: fitur [0, 1, 2, 3] | rentang bin gabungan = [0 .. 16]\n  Bundel #1: fitur [8, 9, 10, 11] | rentang bin gabungan = [0 .. 16]\n  Bundel #2: fitur [4, 5, 6, 7] | rentang bin gabungan = [0 .. 16]",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Bukti Ketakbiasan Rescaling GOSS (1-a)/b = 8.0 (60 Trial, 30% Data Dipakai) ===\nExact Variance Gain (100% baris)      : 3.6725\nGOSS dengan rescaling (1-a)/b = 8.0   : mean=3.6602 | bias=-0.0123 | std=0.1567\nTANPA rescaling (bobot=1.0, BIAS!)    : mean=0.9524 | bias=-2.7201 | std=0.0113\n\n=== 2. Exclusive Feature Bundling (EFB) Greedy Graph Coloring + Bin Offset ===\nDimensi awal (sparse)    : 12 kolom | Kompresi -> 3 bundel (75.0% lebih ramping)\n  Bundel #0: fitur [0, 1, 2, 3] | rentang bin gabungan = [0 .. 16]\n  Bundel #1: fitur [8, 9, 10, 11] | rentang bin gabungan = [0 .. 16]\n  Bundel #2: fitur [4, 5, 6, 7] | rentang bin gabungan = [0 .. 16]",
          "explanation": "Membuktikan lewat 60 replikasi bahwa faktor rescaling GOSS (1-a)/b menjaga estimasi Variance Gain tak bias dibandingkan sampling tanpa rescaling, sekaligus mengimplementasikan kompresi EFB 12 fitur sparse menjadi 3 bundel ber-bin-offset.",
