          "id": "code-ml-16-2-ch16_2_lgb",
          "title": "LightGBM 4.7 Produksi Nyata: Trap num_leaves=127 vs Konfigurasi Terregulasi + Early Stopping vs GOSS",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "16_2_lightgbm_real_leafwise_goss_audit.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nimport lightgbm as lgb\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_classification\nfrom sklearn.metrics import log_loss, roc_auc_score\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n\n# Dataset tabular ukuran kecil-menengah (N=1.500) dengan 10% label noise -> jebakan klasik num_leaves besar!\nX, y = make_classification(\n    n_samples=1500,\n    n_features=24,\n    n_informative=7,\n    n_redundant=5,\n    flip_y=0.10,\n    class_sep=0.9,\n    random_state=42,\n)\nX_dev, X_te, y_dev, y_te = train_test_split(X, y, test_size=0.30, stratify=y, random_state=42)\nX_tr, X_val, y_tr, y_val = train_test_split(X_dev, y_dev, test_size=0.25, stratify=y_dev, random_state=42)\n\n# 1. ANTI-PATTERN: num_leaves=127 tanpa max_depth / min_child_samples / early stopping\nm_overfit = lgb.LGBMClassifier(\n    n_estimators=150,\n    learning_rate=0.10,\n    num_leaves=127,\n    max_depth=-1,\n    min_child_samples=2,\n    reg_lambda=0.0,\n    verbose=-1,\n    random_state=42,\n    n_jobs=1,\n).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n\n# 2. PRODUCTION-SAFE: num_leaves < 2^max_depth + min_child_samples + L2 + early_stopping\nm_safe = lgb.LGBMClassifier(\n    n_estimators=200,\n    learning_rate=0.06,\n    num_leaves=23,\n    max_depth=5,\n    min_child_samples=30,\n    colsample_bytree=0.8,\n    reg_lambda=5.0,\n    verbose=-1,\n    random_state=42,\n    n_jobs=1,\n)\nm_safe.fit(\n    X_tr,\n    y_tr,\n    eval_X=X_val,\n    eval_y=y_val,\n    callbacks=[lgb.early_stopping(20, verbose=False)],\n)\n\n# 3. GOSS MODE: Gradient-Based One-Side Sampling (top_rate=0.2, other_rate=0.1)\nm_goss = lgb.LGBMClassifier(\n    n_estimators=200,\n    learning_rate=0.06,\n    num_leaves=23,\n    max_depth=5,\n    min_child_samples=30,\n    data_sample_strategy=\"goss\",\n    top_rate=0.2,\n    other_rate=0.1,\n    reg_lambda=5.0,\n    verbose=-1,\n    random_state=42,\n    n_jobs=1,\n)\nm_goss.fit(\n    X_tr,\n    y_tr,\n    eval_X=X_val,\n    eval_y=y_val,\n    callbacks=[lgb.early_stopping(20, verbose=False)],\n)\n\nprint(f\"=== Benchmark Nyata LightGBM {lgb.__version__}: Leaf-Wise Trap vs Regulated vs GOSS ===\")\nprint(\"Konfigurasi LightGBM              | BestIter | Train LL | Test LL | Test AUC | Gap LL\")\nprint(\"-\" * 86)\nfor name, model in [\n    (\"Trap (leaves=127, mcs=2, no ES)  \", m_overfit),\n    (\"Regulated (leaves=23, d=5, mcs=30)\", m_safe),\n    (\"GOSS (top=0.2, other=0.1, mcs=30)\", m_goss),\n]:\n    p_tr = model.predict_proba(X_tr)[:, 1]\n    p_te = model.predict_proba(X_te)[:, 1]\n    ll_tr = log_loss(y_tr, p_tr)\n    ll_te = log_loss(y_te, p_te)\n    auc_te = roc_auc_score(y_te, p_te)\n    b_iter = model.best_iteration_ if model.best_iteration_ else model.n_estimators\n    print(f\"{name:33s} | {b_iter:8d} | {ll_tr:8.4f} | {ll_te:7.4f} | {auc_te:8.4f} | {ll_te - ll_tr:+6.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Benchmark Nyata LightGBM 4.7.0: Leaf-Wise Trap vs Regulated vs GOSS ===\nKonfigurasi LightGBM              | BestIter | Train LL | Test LL | Test AUC | Gap LL\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTrap (leaves=127, mcs=2, no ES)   |      150 |   0.0000 |  1.0392 |   0.8772 | +1.0391\nRegulated (leaves=23, d=5, mcs=30) |      133 |   0.1866 |  0.4166 |   0.8894 | +0.2300\nGOSS (top=0.2, other=0.1, mcs=30) |      101 |   0.3049 |  0.4436 |   0.8771 | +0.1386",
          "actualOutput": "=== Benchmark Nyata LightGBM 4.7.0: Leaf-Wise Trap vs Regulated vs GOSS ===\nKonfigurasi LightGBM              | BestIter | Train LL | Test LL | Test AUC | Gap LL\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTrap (leaves=127, mcs=2, no ES)   |      150 |   0.0000 |  1.0392 |   0.8772 | +1.0391\nRegulated (leaves=23, d=5, mcs=30) |      133 |   0.1866 |  0.4166 |   0.8894 | +0.2300\nGOSS (top=0.2, other=0.1, mcs=30) |      101 |   0.3049 |  0.4436 |   0.8771 | +0.1386",
          "explanation": "Menjalankan lightgbm.LGBMClassifier nyata (4.7.0) membandingkan konfigurasi anti-pattern num_leaves=127 tanpa guardrail, konfigurasi terregulasi + callback lgb.early_stopping(20) dengan API modern eval_X/eval_y, serta data_sample_strategy='goss'.",
