          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef goss_rescaled_variance_gain(x, g, threshold: float, a: float = 0.2, b: float = 0.2, seed: int = 42) -> tuple[float, float, float]:\n    x_arr = np.asarray(x, dtype=float)\n    g_arr = np.asarray(g, dtype=float)\n    n = len(g_arr)\n    left_all = x_arr <= threshold\n    nl = int(np.sum(left_all)); nr = n - nl\n    exact_gain = (float(np.sum(g_arr[left_all])) ** 2 / nl + float(np.sum(g_arr[~left_all])) ** 2 / nr) / n\n    top_n = max(1, int(round(a * n)))\n    rand_n = max(1, int(round(b * n)))\n    order = np.argsort(np.abs(g_arr))[::-1]\n    top_idx, rest_idx = order[:top_n], order[top_n:]\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    rand_idx = rng.choice(rest_idx, size=rand_n, replace=False)\n    scale = (1.0 - a) / b\n    lt = x_arr[top_idx] <= threshold\n    lr = x_arr[rand_idx] <= threshold\n    gl_hat = float(np.sum(g_arr[top_idx[lt]])) + scale * float(np.sum(g_arr[rand_idx[lr]]))\n    gr_hat = float(np.sum(g_arr[top_idx[~lt]])) + scale * float(np.sum(g_arr[rand_idx[~lr]]))\n    goss_gain = (gl_hat * gl_hat / nl + gr_hat * gr_hat / nr) / n\n    return (round(exact_gain, 4), round(goss_gain, 4), round(scale, 4))\n```"
